## Root Cause Analysis (5 Whys)

1. Why was the system compromised?  
→ Vulnerable Samba service was exploited  

2. Why was Samba vulnerable?  
→ Outdated version with known exploit  

3. Why was it not updated?  
→ Lack of patch management  

4. Why was patching not enforced?  
→ Weak security policies  

5. Root Cause  
→ Lack of vulnerability management and patching process